## Executive Summary

Global freight operators grapple with hundreds of thousands of unstructured PDFs, scans, and hand-marked cargo manifests. This project introduced an autonomous multi-stage parsing pipeline that blends high-speed spatial OCR with structured LLM extraction.

## System Architecture

The pipeline processes files through a three-tiered pipeline:
1. **Preprocessing & Bounding Box Extraction**: Normalizing orientation, deskewing, and segmenting tables.
2. **Contextual Semantic Extraction**: Utilizing Vision-Language models with strict JSON schema constrained decoding.
3. **Deterministic Business Rule Validation**: Comparing extracted totals against line items and tariff lookup codes before committing to the ERP.
